                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 56.</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Hall</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-03-16"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 16,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Hall is instructed to make known to the Government of Guatemala that it will
                    be held strictly responsible for any injuries to the telegraphic cables,
                    property, or interests of American citizens in Central America committed with
                    its connivance or under its authority.</p>
            </div>
